<title>USA: CNB Bancshares Inc ups quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>CNB Bancshares Inc ups quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.22		     $0.21</p>
<p> Pay		    Oct 30</p>
<p> Record		 Oct 15</p>
<p>NOTE: Considering the five percent stock dividend which is payable October 11, the cash dividend represents a 10 percent increase in the cash dividend payment rate, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
